---
const steps = [
 ['Set the goal', 'You choose the outcome.', 'Help more people complete their first export.'],
 ['Choose what to track', 'Your agent makes the measurement plan.', 'Reuse existing events; add missing starts, completions, and failures.'],
 ['Pull the learnings', 'Find the obstacle in real usage.', 'Compare releases and file sizes. Check feedback and error patterns.'],
 ['Improve the product', 'Turn evidence into a scoped change.', 'Prepare a fix for large exports, with tests and a clear hypothesis.'],
 ['Measure and repeat', 'Keep what works. Learn from the rest.', 'Check completion after release, record the result, and choose the next step.'],
];
---
<figure class="loop" aria-labelledby="loop-caption">
<figcaption id="loop-caption"><span>One goal, from intent to evidence</span><a href="/reports/export-health/">Illustrative example · explore the report ↗</a></figcaption>
<ol>{steps.map(([title, lead, example], i) => <li><span class="number">0{i + 1}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p class="lead">{lead}</p><p>{example}</p></div></li>)}</ol>
<div class="return"><span aria-hidden="true">↻</span> The next run starts with what you learned.</div>
</figure>
<style>
.loop{margin:28px 0 24px;border-block:1px solid var(--rule);padding:20px 0}
figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}figcaption>span{font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em}
ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));list-style:none;padding:0;margin:28px 0;gap:22px}
li{min-width:0}.number{display:block;color:var(--red);font:800 30px var(--display);margin-bottom:18px}h3{font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 10px}p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;color:var(--muted)}p.lead{color:var(--ink);font-weight:650;margin-bottom:8px}
.return{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--rail);padding:12px 16px;font:650 14px var(--body);border-radius:8px}.return span{color:var(--red);font-size:24px}
@media(max-width:1100px){ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}li{display:flex;gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);padding-bottom:18px}.number{margin:0;min-width:40px}li:last-child{border:0;padding:0}}
</style>
